WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.484 --> 00:00:02.345
Hello there!

2
00:00:02.405 --> 00:00:03.985
Who are you?

3
00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:06.246
I am an albatross.

4
00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:11.128
Albatrosses are seabirds.

5
00:00:32.148 --> 00:00:34.289
Your wings are so long!

6
00:00:36.771 --> 00:00:39.412
We have the biggest wingspan of any bird.

7
00:00:41.494 --> 00:00:43.735
My wingspan is over three meters.

8
00:00:45.636 --> 00:00:46.737
Where do you live?

9
00:00:48.598 --> 00:00:50.899
We mostly live in the Southern Hemisphere.

10
00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:55.422
We fly all over the ocean.

11
00:00:57.103 --> 00:00:59.044
We can fly long and far.

12
00:01:02.288 --> 00:01:05.189
Really? Do you ever go on land?

13
00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:13.291
Sometimes. We go on land to see our mates.

14
00:01:16.852 --> 00:01:19.173
Parents also feed their chicks on land.

15
00:01:21.873 --> 00:01:23.494
How long can you fly?

16
00:01:25.134 --> 00:01:27.795
We can travel for years and years.

17
00:01:29.815 --> 00:01:31.816
We glide on the winds like this.

18
00:01:32.604 --> 00:01:38.707
Whee! Why don't you flap your wings?

19
00:01:40.708 --> 00:01:42.489
Our wings are very heavy.

20
00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:47.251
So we don't flap them much.

21
00:01:49.312 --> 00:01:51.713
We save energy when we glide.

22
00:01:53.473 --> 00:01:54.494
What do you eat?

23
00:01:56.335 --> 00:01:58.756
We mainly eat squid and fish.

24
00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:02.732
We can smell food twenty kilometers away.

25
00:02:04.134 --> 00:02:06.677
When we smell food, we dive down.

26
00:02:06.697 --> 00:02:11.343
Oh! I smell a snack.

27
00:02:13.045 --> 00:02:14.187
Time for a dive!

28
00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:17.752
Good-bye, Albatross.
